diff --git a/CHANGES.md b/CHANGES.md
index 7f1b485..4e139cf 100644
--- a/CHANGES.md
+++ b/CHANGES.md
@@ -18,6 +18,10 @@ Unreleased
   `type` callable does to a command-line value. {issue}`3036` {pr}`3808`
 - `path_type` narrows the converted value's type for `convert` and `prompt`.
   {issue}`3822` {pr}`3858`
+- An option's error message with `show_envvar=True` now prints every variable of an
+  `envvar` sequence, rather than the sequence's `repr`. {pr}`3884`
+- An empty `envvar`, such as `[]` or `""`, now shows the same help and error message
+  as no `envvar`. The help screen used to show `[env var: ]`. {pr}`3884`
 - {class}`Parameter` accepts a new `help` argument and {class}`Option` and {class}`Argument`
   inherits it. {meth}`Parameter.to_info_dict` now reports `help` for every kind of parameter.
   {pr}`3861`
